  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1385/272/better-item-in-frame-banner-1-png.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>⚠注意：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將正式透過devHeycronus帳號，在CurseForge、Modrinth及Planet Minecraft上獨家發布與維護。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Better Item in Frame</strong> 是一款Minecraft材質包，能讓你的物品展示框完全<strong>隱形</strong>，使展示的工具與武器更加突出美觀！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>此材質包還能使工具在展示框中呈現<strong>3D外觀</strong>，讓它們看起來更生動逼真——非常適合裝飾或時尚展示你的最佳裝備。</p><p>✨ <strong>特色：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>隱形物品展示框&nbsp;</li>\n<li>展示工具時呈現3D效果 🔧</li>\n<li>完美適用於建築、展示與裝飾 🏠</li>\n</ul><p>使用<strong>Better Item in Frame</strong>讓你的展示栩栩如生，使你的Minecraft世界看起來更精緻且更具沉浸感！ 🌟</p>",
